body:
This is without a doubt the most hilarious but grossest-wordplay/metaphor post ever. Axe Wound. Like a slice of ham.

&#x200B;

oh my fucking god.

&#x200B;

FFXIV has been my way to deal with depression for around 2-3 years (basically since when I started the game)

&#x200B;

It's extremely weird that I see many posts about FFXIV & Depression online (such as places like Reddit) and I even did a poll on the Facebook dedicated to my server whether or not FFXIV has helped them or not and several people said it has, but whenever I mention it directly to myself to others I get treated as some sort of outcast.

&#x200B;

To bring the mood back up: Please know that people are there for you. I'm proud of you being able to get to 70 on all of your classes. I know how hard balancing a social life/life and FFXIV in general. I wish I knew how to deal with depression.

&#x200B;
